<title>HONG KONG: AMR Airline signs HK fuelling contract.</title>
<headline>AMR Airline signs HK fuelling contract.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMR Airline Services Fueling (Hong Kong) Ltd, a division of AMR Corp, said on Tuesday it signed a US$60 million 10-year contract to provide into-plane fuelling services at Hong Kong's new airport at Chek Lap Kok.</p>
</text>
